# Component Rules

- One component per file, named export only
- Props interface defined above the component in the same file
- Max 80 lines per component — extract helpers/sub-components
- No direct data imports — receive everything via props
- Use Lucide React for icons, import individually (not `import * as`)
- Tailwind only: rounded-xl cards, shadow-sm default, hover:shadow-md interactive
- Color palette: blue-500/600, emerald-500, red-500, gray-{50,100,400,500,900}
- Always add transition classes for hover effects
